WEBVTT

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:14.681
MISSION 52
"IT'S JUST A THOUGHT."

00:00:15.473 --> 00:00:18.935
Who can answer this question?

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:20.061
Komi.

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:22.188
Actually, Ushiroda.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:25.191
Yes, sir. The Treaty of Portsmouth.

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:27.277
Yes, that's right.

00:00:27.777 --> 00:00:30.864
-Hey, uh. It's not bullying, you know?
-Open page 125.

00:00:30.947 --> 00:00:33.742
-It's more like the opposite.
-It'll be on the test so take note.

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:36.911
-BREAK TIME
-Sports Day.

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:38.621
And the culture festival.

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:41.207
It's all so nostalgic.

00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:43.626
I don't want to study.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.128
Those are your true feelings.

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:47.172
It's almost winter break, right?

00:00:47.255 --> 00:00:50.300
Yes, it is. I can't wait!

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:51.593
Komi, where do you want to go?

00:00:51.676 --> 00:00:52.844
Heh heh.

00:00:52.927 --> 00:00:54.763
<i>"Are you reading my mind?"</i>

00:00:54.846 --> 00:00:57.098
<i>"I know you are. Heh heh."</i>

00:00:57.182 --> 00:00:59.059
<i>That's what that face says.</i>

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:01.061
Oh! Next is gym class!

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:03.188
Let's go, Komi.

00:01:04.314 --> 00:01:07.108
What's up, Nakanaka?

00:01:07.192 --> 00:01:08.276
Urk!

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:10.403
Mwah-ha-ha!

00:01:10.487 --> 00:01:14.115
Tadano! You are
supposedly good at reading minds.

00:01:14.199 --> 00:01:17.744
But it looks like you failed to read mine!

00:01:17.827 --> 00:01:20.872
Um, you're trying to trick me
by assuming I can read minds

00:01:20.955 --> 00:01:23.958
and thinking,
"You're reading my mind," right?

00:01:24.626 --> 00:01:26.294
How did you know?

00:01:28.838 --> 00:01:30.715
SUDDENLY FEELS EMBARRASSED.

00:01:30.799 --> 00:01:34.594
<i>Tadano understands what it's like</i>
<i>to have an overactive imagination.</i>

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:37.430
I see.

00:01:37.514 --> 00:01:40.016
You want to know what Komi is thinking?

00:01:40.099 --> 00:01:41.142
Yes.

00:01:41.226 --> 00:01:43.144
As Komi's sworn ally,

00:01:43.228 --> 00:01:46.481
I must learn to
understand Komi's feelings.

00:01:46.564 --> 00:01:49.025
And as someone who can read her mind,

00:01:49.108 --> 00:01:50.568
Tada… you…

00:01:50.652 --> 00:01:53.071
I thought I'd ask for help.

00:01:53.154 --> 00:01:55.448
You can call me whatever you like.

00:01:56.032 --> 00:01:57.408
Let me think.

00:01:57.492 --> 00:02:00.495
Even I don't know exactly…

00:02:00.578 --> 00:02:04.040
Your methods. Teach them to me too.

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:05.458
<i>She's here.</i>

00:02:05.542 --> 00:02:07.836
Alright. Let's observe some scenarios

00:02:07.919 --> 00:02:10.588
and try to guess what Komi is thinking.

00:02:10.672 --> 00:02:14.217
That's a good idea! How unlike you.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:15.135
Unlike?

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:17.345
Clean up the balls!

00:02:17.428 --> 00:02:18.972
Hey, that's alright.

00:02:19.055 --> 00:02:20.849
I'll do it for you!

00:02:23.059 --> 00:02:24.185
Got it!

00:02:24.269 --> 00:02:26.187
Yeaaaahhhh!

00:02:26.938 --> 00:02:29.399
Now, what is Komi thinking?

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:32.652
Are you kidding? That's too easy!

00:02:32.735 --> 00:02:35.905
"I'm free of a boring task.
Where's Yamai?"

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:37.365
-Right?
-Wrong!

00:02:37.448 --> 00:02:39.742
Where did you get that cue card?

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:42.871
Here I am! Komi!

00:02:42.954 --> 00:02:44.164
"Very good, peasant."

00:02:44.247 --> 00:02:47.333
Wrong. You have a cue card too.

00:02:47.417 --> 00:02:51.171
-The answer is, "I want to tidy up too!"
-FEELS GUILTY

00:02:51.254 --> 00:02:53.089
Are you sure?

00:02:53.172 --> 00:02:54.424
Probably.

00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:57.468
Komi, can I borrow
your electronic dictionary?

00:03:01.598 --> 00:03:04.392
10 MINUTES LATER

00:03:08.771 --> 00:03:10.231
And then…

00:03:10.315 --> 00:03:13.693
Okay, now try it with this situation.

00:03:13.776 --> 00:03:16.487
"Shut up and give back my dictionary."

00:03:16.571 --> 00:03:18.823
-Right?
-Wrong.

00:03:18.907 --> 00:03:20.158
But I agree with you.

00:03:20.241 --> 00:03:24.370
"They're talking, so it's hard
to approach them." Totally.

00:03:24.454 --> 00:03:26.706
That's part of it.

00:03:26.789 --> 00:03:28.374
-Very close.
-What?

00:03:28.458 --> 00:03:32.378
The answer is,
"Are they gossiping about me?"

00:03:34.172 --> 00:03:37.550
Wow! A rainbow! There's a huge rainbow!

00:03:37.634 --> 00:03:41.012
Let's see! Where is it?

00:03:41.095 --> 00:03:43.806
Wow, it's huge!

00:03:45.183 --> 00:03:47.477
This is an easy one. Give it a try.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:49.229
"I'll do what Yamai does,

00:03:49.312 --> 00:03:51.981
and take a picture of the rainbow
for social media.

00:03:52.065 --> 00:03:54.776
Oh, I should tell Yamai my account!"

00:03:54.859 --> 00:03:56.319
-Yeah!
-Nope.

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:57.946
Are you doing this on purpose?

00:03:58.029 --> 00:03:59.239
Heh.

00:03:59.322 --> 00:04:03.451
"Who cares about social media?
Don't post pictures of the sky, dirtbags."

00:04:03.534 --> 00:04:05.370
<i>That's just your personal opinion!</i>

00:04:05.453 --> 00:04:06.412
Wrong.

00:04:06.496 --> 00:04:09.666
-Huh? What do you mean?
-DIRTBAGS?

00:04:10.667 --> 00:04:13.378
The War of the Women
is breaking out again.

00:04:13.461 --> 00:04:14.671
<i>She doesn't fuss!</i>

00:04:14.754 --> 00:04:17.548
<i>Even if a huge rainbow appears,</i>
<i>Komi doesn't fuss!</i>

00:04:17.632 --> 00:04:20.051
<i>Komi's a much bigger person</i>
<i>than that rainbow!</i>

00:04:20.134 --> 00:04:21.344
<i>Wrong.</i>

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:24.847
KOMI WANTS TO GO SEE IT
BUT CAN'T JOIN THE GROUP.

00:04:24.931 --> 00:04:28.309
-HOME ECONOMICS
-Work with your group to make the dish.

00:04:28.393 --> 00:04:31.312
Komi, you wash the vegetables.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:41.364
-Huh? Komi?
-Okay, how about this…

00:04:41.447 --> 00:04:42.699
Hey!

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:46.160
"I'm thinking about the next step
in the recipe." This is it!

00:04:46.244 --> 00:04:49.747
"I don't know the next step
in the recipe." It's gotta be this.

00:04:49.831 --> 00:04:52.333
Huh? Komi's good at cooking, you know.

00:04:52.417 --> 00:04:54.335
Huh? Whatever!

00:04:54.419 --> 00:04:57.714
The answer is,
"Thinking about the rainbow."

00:04:57.797 --> 00:04:59.799
-DIDN'T GET TO SEE IT.
-She was still stuck on that!

00:05:01.843 --> 00:05:03.970
"I want to eat Yamai's home cooking!"

00:05:04.053 --> 00:05:06.347
"I want to invite Nakanaka to eat!"

00:05:06.431 --> 00:05:07.348
"I want to be with Yamai!"

00:05:07.432 --> 00:05:09.017
"I wonder where Nakanaka is?"

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:10.226
"I love Yamai!"

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:11.602
"I want to play games with…"

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:15.440
I'm the one who knows Komi best.

00:05:15.523 --> 00:05:19.569
I've hung out with Komi alone you know.

00:05:19.652 --> 00:05:23.865
Neither of you have gotten one right yet.

00:05:27.327 --> 00:05:29.579
K-Komi!

00:05:29.662 --> 00:05:31.789
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

00:05:31.873 --> 00:05:34.250
What? What indeed.

00:05:34.334 --> 00:05:36.919
We just happened to be walking together.

00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:39.172
-Don't misunderstand.
-Yeah!

00:05:39.839 --> 00:05:42.508
"I noticed that you were watching me."

00:05:42.592 --> 00:05:44.802
"You were having fun talking, too."

00:05:44.886 --> 00:05:46.929
<i>It's over.</i>

00:05:47.472 --> 00:05:50.600
-<i>She's angry!</i>
-<i>She's totally angry!</i>

00:05:50.683 --> 00:05:53.811
We didn't mean anything bad…

00:05:54.771 --> 00:05:56.022
by it.

00:05:57.106 --> 00:05:59.734
WANTS TO JOIN IN.

00:06:01.778 --> 00:06:03.571
Since we're all here.

00:06:03.654 --> 00:06:05.990
Let's go to a cafe after school.

00:06:06.491 --> 00:06:07.533
<i>Why?</i>

00:06:07.617 --> 00:06:09.494
-NOD
-<i>Is it really okay?</i>

00:06:09.577 --> 00:06:12.246
At the very least let me pay for yours!

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:15.208
No, I'll pay! Let me pay!

00:06:15.291 --> 00:06:17.335
-Me!
-No, me!

00:06:17.418 --> 00:06:20.880
NOBODY HAS TO PAY FOR ME.
JUST STOP FIGHTING.

00:06:20.963 --> 00:06:22.173
Okay.

00:06:22.256 --> 00:06:23.883
KOMI! ME! KOMI! ME!

00:06:23.966 --> 00:06:24.967
MISSION 53
"IT'S JUST A FANTASY, PART 2."

00:06:25.051 --> 00:06:28.513
<i>Several days after,</i>
<i>"Of all the girls, who would you date?"</i>

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:31.682
<i>The boys got together again.</i>

00:06:32.391 --> 00:06:36.020
The second round of
"Of all the girls, who would you date?"

00:06:36.104 --> 00:06:37.271
Shall we begin?

00:06:37.355 --> 00:06:38.523
<i>They're back at it?</i>

00:06:38.606 --> 00:06:41.317
We failed to reach a conclusion last time.

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:46.322
Everyone thought about it at home,
and we put something together.

00:06:47.573 --> 00:06:50.118
We've finally made a Komi episode!

00:06:50.201 --> 00:06:53.204
Let's watch, along with two more episodes!

00:06:53.287 --> 00:06:54.330
WOW!

00:06:54.413 --> 00:06:57.291
<i>Part of me is looking forward to this!</i>

00:06:57.375 --> 00:06:59.627
OF ALL THE GIRLS, WHO WOULD YOU DATE?
ONEMINE VERSION

00:07:04.257 --> 00:07:05.883
I'm so glad the weather is nice.

00:07:05.967 --> 00:07:07.552
Yeah!

00:07:08.636 --> 00:07:11.472
Ta-da! I made a picnic lunch!

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:39.542
Not a word!
I love how she does that silently!

00:07:39.625 --> 00:07:41.544
She has immense big sister vibes.

00:07:41.627 --> 00:07:44.464
<i>Onemine is the picture of stability.</i>

00:07:44.547 --> 00:07:46.883
OF ALL THE GIRLS, WHO WOULD YOU DATE?
OTORI VERSION

00:07:50.511 --> 00:07:51.721
I'm home.

00:07:53.723 --> 00:07:56.476
Welcome back!

00:07:56.559 --> 00:07:59.854
Do you want dinner?

00:08:03.524 --> 00:08:05.818
What's wrong?

00:08:06.819 --> 00:08:10.990
I made a terrible mistake at work.

00:08:12.617 --> 00:08:14.452
I'm done for.

00:08:21.083 --> 00:08:23.002
There, there.

00:08:24.045 --> 00:08:26.005
It's alright.

00:08:26.547 --> 00:08:29.509
You'll be okay.

00:08:30.009 --> 00:08:32.094
-Whoa.
-I'm gonna cry.

00:08:32.178 --> 00:08:33.596
I wish she was my mom!

00:08:33.679 --> 00:08:36.182
<i>Those guys must be so tired.</i>

00:08:36.265 --> 00:08:38.309
OF ALL THE GIRLS, WHO WOULD YOU DATE?
KOMI VERSION

00:08:41.479 --> 00:08:42.730
The era has changed!

00:08:43.231 --> 00:08:47.360
Anyway, that's going to happen
to overthrow the shogunate.

00:08:48.986 --> 00:08:50.071
My liege.

00:08:50.154 --> 00:08:51.781
I see.

00:08:51.864 --> 00:08:53.908
And when that happens,

00:08:54.575 --> 00:08:57.411
Japan will have a bright future.

00:08:57.495 --> 00:08:58.371
Yes.

00:08:58.454 --> 00:09:00.206
<i>What an empty conversation…</i>

00:09:01.332 --> 00:09:03.125
This is an investigation!

00:09:03.209 --> 00:09:04.835
Who goes there?!

00:09:04.919 --> 00:09:07.255
Save your breath!

00:09:08.673 --> 00:09:09.840
A windmill!

00:09:09.924 --> 00:09:14.220
My husband is not
going to meet his end here.

00:09:16.389 --> 00:09:17.890
Escape while you can.

00:09:18.599 --> 00:09:20.226
O-Osho!

00:09:25.189 --> 00:09:27.191
I'll be the one to face you.

00:09:28.985 --> 00:09:30.570
I'll take several heads

00:09:30.653 --> 00:09:33.239
before you go.

00:09:34.115 --> 00:09:39.036
A period drama was the only way
I could imagine being with Komi.

00:09:40.037 --> 00:09:41.330
You did what you could.

00:09:43.457 --> 00:09:45.543
Alright, so who do you want to date?

00:09:45.626 --> 00:09:47.712
I'd like someone who's like a buddy.

00:09:47.795 --> 00:09:50.006
But I also want a video game partner.

00:09:50.673 --> 00:09:52.341
But it's gotta be…

00:09:52.425 --> 00:09:53.467
Ko…

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:03.894
<i>Meeting adjourned!</i>

00:10:03.978 --> 00:10:08.232
<i>Fantasies must be done</i>
<i>in secret (from girls).</i>

00:10:09.025 --> 00:10:10.985
BOY'S FANTASY EPISODE RANKING
NUMBER 1: NAKANAKA!

00:10:11.068 --> 00:10:12.903
NOT THAT I CARE!
(CARES A LITTLE)

00:10:13.738 --> 00:10:16.657
<i>Deep, dark, glimmering hair.</i>

00:10:16.741 --> 00:10:20.161
<i>Clear skin without a single blemish.</i>

00:10:20.244 --> 00:10:23.664
<i>At once both like a regal empress</i>
<i>and a mother goddess.</i>

00:10:23.748 --> 00:10:26.042
<i>An absolutely incomparable presence.</i>

00:10:28.794 --> 00:10:30.171
<i>Komi.</i>

00:10:30.254 --> 00:10:32.506
<i>Even she…</i>

00:10:35.009 --> 00:10:37.219
-GURGLE
-PUNCH!

00:10:37.303 --> 00:10:41.515
<i>…sometimes sleeps in and misses breakfast.</i>

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:44.977
LUNCH BREAK

00:10:45.061 --> 00:10:47.521
<i>My name is Makoto Katai.</i>

00:10:48.022 --> 00:10:50.232
<i>My hobby is sewing patchwork.</i>

00:10:50.733 --> 00:10:53.235
<i>The other day, I made my first friend.</i>

00:10:53.319 --> 00:10:57.573
<i>And I met Commu, a mentor for</i>
<i>communication, which I find difficult.</i>

00:10:58.658 --> 00:11:01.077
<i>My high school life is going smoothly!</i>

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:04.455
<i>Today I'm going to invite Tadano to lunch.</i>

00:11:04.538 --> 00:11:06.415
<i>Watch me, Mentor.</i>

00:11:06.499 --> 00:11:08.042
-LEER
-SHIVER

00:11:12.046 --> 00:11:13.506
<i>Here I go.</i>

00:11:13.589 --> 00:11:16.092
<i>I've thought of the perfect line</i>
<i>for inviting him to lunch.</i>

00:11:16.592 --> 00:11:19.595
-That was nice of the literature teacher…
-Tadano, hey.

00:11:19.678 --> 00:11:23.015
<i>Oh no! Was that too casual?</i>
<i>I'm acting friendly!</i>

00:11:23.099 --> 00:11:25.518
<i>But maybe a little too familiar?</i>

00:11:25.601 --> 00:11:26.685
Hello.

00:11:26.769 --> 00:11:29.063
What's up, Katai?

00:11:33.651 --> 00:11:35.778
<i>I forgot my line!</i>

00:11:35.861 --> 00:11:37.905
<i>Commu is watching me.</i>

00:11:37.988 --> 00:11:40.491
-<i>She really is scary.</i>
-STARE

00:11:40.574 --> 00:11:42.451
Are you alright?

00:11:42.535 --> 00:11:44.995
<i>I think he wants to eat lunch together.</i>

00:11:45.079 --> 00:11:47.331
<i>Was I going to ask him to eat outside?</i>

00:11:47.415 --> 00:11:48.999
<i>No, it's cold outside.</i>

00:11:49.083 --> 00:11:52.628
<i>But in class with everyone watching…</i>
<i>What if he's annoyed?</i>

00:11:52.711 --> 00:11:55.714
<i>Anyway I have to find the words. Uh…</i>

00:11:55.798 --> 00:11:57.425
Let's take a walk.

00:11:57.508 --> 00:11:59.135
EVERYONE'S FEELINGS INCLUDING KATAI.

00:11:59.927 --> 00:12:01.429
<i>Now I've done it.</i>

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:05.433
<i>That was so rude of me.</i>

00:12:05.516 --> 00:12:07.601
<i>I wish there was a hole</i>
<i>I could crawl into.</i>

00:12:08.477 --> 00:12:12.648
Sorry, I'm gonna go today.

00:12:12.731 --> 00:12:13.607
YOU'RE GOING?!

00:12:13.691 --> 00:12:16.569
<i>Why does this always happen?</i>

00:12:17.695 --> 00:12:19.947
-Hey!
-Huh?

00:12:20.030 --> 00:12:21.490
Hey, Katai!

00:12:21.991 --> 00:12:23.534
<i>A miracle?</i>

00:12:24.201 --> 00:12:26.078
LUNCH

00:12:26.162 --> 00:12:28.747
<i>Wow! Lunch with a friend.</i>

00:12:28.831 --> 00:12:31.041
<i>It's a dream come true!</i>

00:12:31.667 --> 00:12:34.795
<i>I'm sure my mentor</i>
<i>must have said something.</i>

00:12:34.879 --> 00:12:36.630
-Go to him!
-<i>Mentor!</i>

00:12:36.714 --> 00:12:38.174
<i>Thank you my ment…</i>

00:12:39.175 --> 00:12:42.303
-<i>Mentor! Why did you come?</i>
-WORRIED ABOUT TADANO.

00:12:42.386 --> 00:12:43.929
<i>Oh, I know.</i>

00:12:44.013 --> 00:12:46.515
<i>Eating lunch together isn't the goal.</i>

00:12:46.599 --> 00:12:50.561
<i>Having fun together</i>
<i>and getting closer as friends is the goal!</i>

00:12:51.061 --> 00:12:53.981
<i>She's watching over me.</i>

00:12:54.857 --> 00:12:56.692
<i>I can do it!</i>

00:12:56.775 --> 00:12:58.736
Let's eat!

00:12:58.819 --> 00:13:01.822
Wow. Katai, your lunch looks good!

00:13:01.906 --> 00:13:03.741
Did your mom make it for you?

00:13:05.242 --> 00:13:07.244
-Got any hobbies?
-<i>Is this speed dating?</i>

00:13:07.328 --> 00:13:10.748
Um, I read comics
and I play video games a little.

00:13:10.831 --> 00:13:12.166
Oh.

00:13:15.336 --> 00:13:16.670
<i>A-Alright!</i>

00:13:16.754 --> 00:13:19.173
<i>That conversation went great, didn't…</i>

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:23.135
-<i>She looks disappointed!</i>
-CAN'T UNDERSTAND WHAT SHE IS SEEING.

00:13:23.969 --> 00:13:27.097
<i>I've got to show</i>
<i>how friendly we're getting.</i>

00:13:27.181 --> 00:13:29.683
<i>Oh! I know!</i>

00:13:29.767 --> 00:13:31.560
Open up!

00:13:32.561 --> 00:13:35.397
<i>Even Tadano couldn't help but flinch.</i>

00:13:35.481 --> 00:13:37.358
HE WAS DISTURBED BUT HE STILL ATE IT.

00:13:37.441 --> 00:13:38.901
<i>Yay!</i>

00:13:38.984 --> 00:13:41.570
<i>How about it! Tadano and I are getting…</i>

00:13:41.654 --> 00:13:45.032
-<i>No? Mentor, you're so strict!</i>
-KOMI HAS COMPLICATED FEELINGS.

00:13:45.115 --> 00:13:48.494
<i>What more can I do?</i>

00:13:50.412 --> 00:13:51.330
<i>Ah, yes.</i>

00:13:51.413 --> 00:13:54.083
<i>My mentor is signaling what to do.</i>

00:13:54.583 --> 00:13:56.335
<i>G-Got it.</i>

00:13:56.418 --> 00:13:58.879
<i>I'm a little embarrassed, but I'll try it!</i>

00:14:04.927 --> 00:14:06.345
GRAB

00:14:06.428 --> 00:14:07.972
A Working Club Hostess Tells All

00:14:08.055 --> 00:14:11.100
51 Ways to Get Friendly<i>,</i>
<i>Chapter 1, page 12.</i>

00:14:11.183 --> 00:14:12.810
<i>"Physical touch is best!"</i>

00:14:12.893 --> 00:14:15.563
-<i>This is what my mentor was trying to say.</i>
-RIGHT AROUND HERE

00:14:15.646 --> 00:14:20.025
<i>I-I'm shy, but if it'll bring us closer.</i>

00:14:20.943 --> 00:14:21.986
<i>Pulling away?</i>

00:14:24.196 --> 00:14:26.448
<i>W-What should I…</i>

00:14:26.532 --> 00:14:28.659
BUT HE CAN'T BREAK AWAY.

00:14:28.742 --> 00:14:31.954
-KOMI VISION
-You ate my lunch.

00:14:32.037 --> 00:14:34.623
-SHAKEDOWN
-Pay me 20,000 yen.

00:14:34.707 --> 00:14:38.502
-<i>She looks like she's going to come over!</i>
-WANTS TO STOP HIM BUT IS SCARED.

00:14:38.586 --> 00:14:41.839
<i>I can't do this anymore! Help me, Mentor!</i>

00:14:42.506 --> 00:14:43.340
<i>Chaos.</i>

00:14:43.424 --> 00:14:46.802
You don't have to force it.

00:14:50.639 --> 00:14:54.476
I'm not entirely sure
what you were trying to do.

00:14:55.185 --> 00:14:58.314
But when you're with me,
you don't have to act tough.

00:14:58.397 --> 00:15:01.775
You can just be yourself,
and that's fine with me.

00:15:04.653 --> 00:15:05.696
Okay.

00:15:13.662 --> 00:15:14.997
-GURGLE
-TUMMY NOISES.

00:15:15.706 --> 00:15:17.374
Huh? Komi?

00:15:17.875 --> 00:15:21.712
Would you like to eat with us as well?

00:15:21.795 --> 00:15:23.505
I'll introduce you to Katai.

00:15:23.589 --> 00:15:25.007
<i>Lunch with my mentor?</i>

00:15:44.026 --> 00:15:46.111
Katai, this is Komi.

00:15:46.862 --> 00:15:49.073
I think you two would get along.

00:15:49.156 --> 00:15:50.199
Both of you…

00:15:51.116 --> 00:15:52.868
You can't say that!

00:15:52.952 --> 00:15:53.994
Najimi!

00:15:54.578 --> 00:15:56.205
Since when…

00:15:56.288 --> 00:15:58.832
Pretty much since the beginning.

00:15:58.916 --> 00:16:01.961
I'll say it again. You can't say that!

00:16:06.799 --> 00:16:08.926
<i>After all, it's funnier this way!</i>

00:16:10.594 --> 00:16:12.638
Anyway, let me join you for lunch.

00:16:12.721 --> 00:16:13.973
Sure.

00:16:14.056 --> 00:16:16.225
<i>Everyone ate lunch together.</i>

00:16:19.311 --> 00:16:21.188
MISSION 55
"IT'S JUST ROASTED SWEET POTATOES"

00:16:21.271 --> 00:16:26.068
<i>Roasted sweet potatoes!</i>

00:16:26.151 --> 00:16:28.904
<i>Hot and delicious!</i>

00:16:28.988 --> 00:16:32.616
-FIDGET
-<i>Sweet potatoes!</i>

00:16:33.283 --> 00:16:37.287
<i>Roasted sweet potatoes!</i>

00:16:50.050 --> 00:16:51.218
FLOATING

00:16:56.974 --> 00:16:59.351
GHOST

00:16:59.435 --> 00:17:01.812
KOMI'S AFRAID TO CALL OUT

00:17:01.895 --> 00:17:04.023
ROASTED SWEET POTATOES

00:17:04.106 --> 00:17:06.025
KOMI CAN'T HELP BUT SHAKE HER HEAD.

00:17:06.108 --> 00:17:08.485
KOMI DOESN'T KNOW WHY SHE SHOOK HER HEAD.

00:17:17.786 --> 00:17:20.581
ROASTED SWEET POTATOES
300 YEN

00:17:26.545 --> 00:17:28.422
REAL LIFE "RED LIGHT, GREEN LIGHT"

00:17:33.302 --> 00:17:35.095
COLD

00:17:40.309 --> 00:17:42.061
ONE…

00:17:42.144 --> 00:17:43.937
TWO…

00:17:44.021 --> 00:17:45.814
FIVE!

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:52.488
-KOMI DID PAY FULL PRICE.
-THANK YOU!

00:17:54.198 --> 00:17:55.699
MAYBE FIVE WAS TOO MANY.

00:17:59.745 --> 00:18:01.872
WARM

00:18:13.801 --> 00:18:18.430
<i>Ever since the culture festival,</i>
<i>something has been bothering me.</i>

00:18:22.893 --> 00:18:26.271
<i>Everyone in the school</i>
<i>saw me dressed as a girl!</i>

00:18:26.355 --> 00:18:27.773
TADANO

00:18:34.071 --> 00:18:37.157
Why did I dress up like a girl?

00:18:37.241 --> 00:18:39.701
I could have at least
changed for the after-party!

00:18:39.785 --> 00:18:43.205
<i>A new page was added</i>
<i>to Tadano's dark history.</i>

00:18:43.288 --> 00:18:46.250
<i>I got all caught up in the moment</i>
<i>and acted like a fool!</i>

00:18:46.333 --> 00:18:47.417
EXACTLY.

00:18:48.877 --> 00:18:51.505
<i>How can I deal with these feelings?</i>

00:18:59.972 --> 00:19:02.683
<i>Komi's face at that moment.</i>

00:19:05.227 --> 00:19:06.562
Are we…

00:19:11.608 --> 00:19:15.404
<i>What was I trying to say then?</i>

00:19:21.785 --> 00:19:23.412
No! No, no, no!

00:19:23.495 --> 00:19:26.248
I don't know what you're doing,
but stop shaking the bed!

00:19:27.708 --> 00:19:30.169
<i>I've got to think calmly.</i>

00:19:30.252 --> 00:19:32.963
<i>I would never feel that way.</i>

00:19:36.008 --> 00:19:40.220
<i>Komi's beautiful and cute, too.</i>

00:19:40.304 --> 00:19:42.931
<i>But that's precisely why…</i>

00:19:43.724 --> 00:19:47.352
<i>No, no, no. What am I thinking?</i>

00:19:48.395 --> 00:19:49.813
I'm going out.

00:19:49.897 --> 00:19:52.024
-To buy porn?
-No!

00:20:16.548 --> 00:20:18.800
<i>Oh, Komi!</i>

00:20:18.884 --> 00:20:20.385
<i>What odd timing.</i>

00:20:22.804 --> 00:20:26.767
G-Good evening, Komi. What a coincidence.

00:20:27.809 --> 00:20:28.644
BLUSH

00:20:28.727 --> 00:20:31.146
You bought some roasted sweet potatoes?

00:20:33.357 --> 00:20:36.151
It's so dark out, I'll walk you home.

00:20:39.947 --> 00:20:41.406
Are you alright?

00:20:46.536 --> 00:20:48.664
<i>I should invite her out.</i>

00:20:48.747 --> 00:20:51.708
<i>I don't have anything happening</i>
<i>during winter break.</i>

00:20:51.792 --> 00:20:54.169
<i>I do like hanging out with Komi.</i>

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:58.674
<i>As a friend, as a friend! Of course.</i>

00:21:02.678 --> 00:21:05.305
<i>But if I'm going to ask her to hang out,</i>

00:21:05.931 --> 00:21:10.060
<i>I should suggest</i>
<i>a specific day and activity.</i>

00:21:13.188 --> 00:21:16.275
Okay, take care, then.

00:21:16.358 --> 00:21:18.735
<i>I failed.</i>

00:21:24.908 --> 00:21:26.159
For me?

00:21:27.536 --> 00:21:29.288
Thank you.

00:21:34.626 --> 00:21:37.879
Let's do something together
over winter break too!

00:21:42.592 --> 00:21:45.262
Thanks for this.

00:21:45.345 --> 00:21:46.305
See ya.

00:21:59.067 --> 00:22:01.069
<i>Winter break has begun.</i>

00:23:30.992 --> 00:23:33.411
BONUS SCENE

00:23:33.495 --> 00:23:35.413
That was delicious!

00:23:35.497 --> 00:23:36.748
Oh yeah, Komi!

00:23:36.832 --> 00:23:39.042
You should get Katai to write his name!

00:23:40.252 --> 00:23:44.172
-Ta-da! Komi's Book of Friends!
-JUST A MEMO PAD

00:23:44.256 --> 00:23:48.051
We're getting all of Komi's friends
to write their names!

00:23:50.387 --> 00:23:54.683
<i>I see. My mentor wants</i>
<i>the names of her apprentices.</i>

00:23:54.766 --> 00:23:56.184
TADANO, NAJIMI, AGARI, YAMAI
YADANO, NAKANAKA…

00:23:56.268 --> 00:23:57.435
<i>So many apprentices!</i>

00:23:57.519 --> 00:23:59.187
<i>My mentor is so formidable!</i>

00:23:59.271 --> 00:24:01.106
<i>Katai became her apprentice.</i>

00:24:01.189 --> 00:24:03.024
Subtitle translation by: Claire Tanaka
